# Dry-run publish gate phase 1: Release Scope & Identity — Kestrel Toolkit
# release-candidate case study (a fictional 3-crate Rust workspace's v3.4.0
# dry-run publish gate; see packs/dry-run-publish-pack/templates/
# dry-run-publish-case-study.ttl.tmpl for the case-study rationale). One
# domain FRAGMENT of the shared kestrel-dry-run-publish-cycle domain: this
# phase's 3 actions chain
# scope-engaged -> scope-step1-done -> scope-step2-done -> scope-complete,
# so the merged cycle plan can only reach this phase after the problem's
# init atom (scope-engaged) is asserted. 8-constraint split: every
# precondition/effect/goal here is a 1-conjunct (and ...) — far inside
# PDDL8_MAX_CONJUNCTS=8 — and each action takes 1 parameter
# (PDDL8_MAX_PARAMS=8); the dry-run harness asserts these bounds
# mechanically for every fragment (reusing
# crate::bench::togaf::verify_eight_constraint_split verbatim, the same
# function soc2_test.rs imports).
#
# scope-engaged is the ONE init atom of the whole merged problem; every
# later phase is forced by the precondition chain, never by an extra init
# atom.
#
# DRY-RUN-OVERCLAIM FENCE: no action effect below is named "published",
# "crates-io-uploaded", or "release-complete" — the LOCAL, REVERSIBLE
# scope-and-identity gate is modeled here, never an external upload. See
# packs/dry-run-publish-pack/ontology.ttl for the full fence disclosure.
#
# Public-ontology doctrine: the artifact node is a blank node; the phase is
# identified by its public SKOS notation. The only private predicate is
# the cng pipeline's ABI carrier ceng:pddlDomain (urn:chatman:engine#),
# disclosed in packs/dry-run-publish-pack/ontology.ttl.
@prefix ceng:    <urn:chatman:engine#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

_:artifact
    skos:notation "DRY-RUN-SCOPE" ;
    dcterms:description "Release Scope & Identity domain fragment of the kestrel-dry-run-publish-cycle STRIPS domain."@en ;
    ceng:pddlDomain """
(define (domain kestrel-dry-run-publish-cycle)
  (:requirements :strips)
  (:predicates
    (scope-engaged ?x)
    (scope-step1-done ?x)
    (scope-step2-done ?x)
    (scope-complete ?x))
  (:action define-publish-set-and-version
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (scope-engaged ?x))
    :effect (and (scope-step1-done ?x)))
  (:action sync-release-control-docs
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (scope-step1-done ?x))
    :effect (and (scope-step2-done ?x)))
  (:action bind-git-sha-on-clean-worktree
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (scope-step2-done ?x))
    :effect (and (scope-complete ?x))))
""" .
